      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B005",
      "text": "The package exposes the required task API paths `featurelifted.configure`, `featurelifted.get_logger`, `featurelifted.reset_defaults`, and the frozen processors with the kinds listed in this contract."
